     "text": "The Dreadnought releases a swarm of tiny, short-lived components from the hives that clog its fighter bays. Starships in a 1-zone emanation take 4d8 acid damage (DC 28 basic Fortitude save). On a failed save, they’re also off-guard until the end of the Dreadnought’s next turn."
    },
