     "name": "Hundredfold Laser Barrage",
     "cost": "two-actions",
     "traits": [],
     "text": "The Dreadnought’s commandeered laser cannons unleash a fusillade of fire. Starships in a 2-zone cone take 6d6 fire damage (DC 28 basic Reflex save)."
    },
    {
     "name": "Ultimate Mindwarp Cannon",
     "cost": "three-actions",
     "traits": [],
     "text": "The Dreadnought concentrates the full force of its colony mind through its spinal weapon, releasing a wave of psychic force in a 6-zone line in the direction of its heading. Starships in the area take 12d8 mental damage with a DC 30 basic Will save. On a failure, each member of the starship’s crew becomes frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical failure); this is an emotion, fear, and mental effect. within the szynegator swarm’s comm occlusion aura are malfunctioning as long as they’re in the aura."
    }
